              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mommy_of_none"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just soak the corn with husks on from anywhere from 1/2 hour to many hours.\nGrill over high heat, turning until the husked are mostly blackened.\nTake off heat and wait about 1/2 hour or so until cool enough to handle.\nCorn peels easily, silks come off easy, corn ready to eat as is or whatever you want to add to it.",
