              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Becky Fadely Harris"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious and simple. We don't like corn with sugar so this recipe was perfect. I ended up removing all the husks and just used aluminum foil and it was still tasty and tender. I also soaked the corn in warm water with salt ( maybe 2 qts. Water to 1/4 c salt) to tenderize it a little. Soaked for about 2 hours.",
